r><tr id="NHA000031"><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top py-0 w-15    "></td><td class=" border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-28 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap  "><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-[1.1em] shrink-0 align-[-0.15em] mr-1 text-ink-muted"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg><a class="visitable" href="/en/dataset/NHA000031" data-discover="true">NHA000031</a></td><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-28 py-1.5   ">Genotype frequencies in each disease<br/>(JSNP data)</td><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-48 py-1.5   "><ul><li><span>Genotyping by array</span></li></ul></td><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-28 py-1.5   "><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 align-top text-nowrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-[1.1em] shrink-0 align-[-0.15em] text-brand"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1"></path></svg>Unrestricted-access</span></td><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-28 py-1.5   ">2015-12-28</td></tr><tr id="NHA000014"><td class="max-w-88 border-line border-b px-3 align-top py-0 w-15    "></td><td class=" border-line border-b px-3 align-top min-w-28 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap  "><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[1.1em] w-[1.1em] shrink-0 align-[-0.15em] mr-1 text-ink-muted"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><